{"seq":3,"slug":"travels-and-the-academy","title":"Travels And The Academy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/travels-and-the-academy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"travels-and-syracuse","title":"游历与叙拉古","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/travels-and-the-academy/travels-and-syracuse","wordCount":1884,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-the-academy","title":"创立学园","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/travels-and-the-academy/founding-the-academy","wordCount":1984,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章追溯柏拉图苏格拉底之死后的游历与学园的创立。柏拉图游历地中海世界，三度前往叙拉古，试图将&quot;哲学王&quot;的政治理想付诸实践，却屡遭挫败，深刻体验了理想与现实的鸿沟。约公元前387年，他在雅典创立&quot;学园&quot;——西方历史上第一所大学，教学、研究、著述长达约四十年。本章呈现柏拉图思想成熟期的人生历程。</p>\n"}